WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.093 --> 00:00:02.341
- [Narrator] With unique mirrors

00:00:02.341 --> 00:00:04.835
creating the illusion of infinite books,

00:00:04.835 --> 00:00:06.851
this Chinese library and bookstore

00:00:06.851 --> 00:00:10.408
is every story lover's dream come true.

00:00:10.408 --> 00:00:14.362
(smooth electronic music)

00:00:14.362 --> 00:00:17.786
While this may look like an
ordinary shop from the outside,

00:00:17.786 --> 00:00:20.006
inside readers are invited to settle in

00:00:20.006 --> 00:00:23.337
for an otherworldly
storytelling adventure.

00:00:23.337 --> 00:00:24.566
The black mirrored floor

00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:27.471
is one of two distinct design elements.

00:00:27.471 --> 00:00:29.981
The mirrors create the
illusion of a mirage,

00:00:29.981 --> 00:00:31.404
meant to symbolize water,

00:00:31.404 --> 00:00:34.839
which has a long-held
significance in Yangzhou culture.

00:00:34.839 --> 00:00:38.171
In the past, famous authors and
poets gathered by the canals

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:40.611
in this Chinese town.

00:00:40.611 --> 00:00:43.570
Secondly, the arched ceilings
link throughout the library,

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:47.368
which represent the connection
between people and books.

00:00:47.368 --> 00:00:49.826
Zhongshuge cherishes Yangzhou's history

00:00:49.826 --> 00:00:52.155
while embracing the future head-on,

00:00:52.155 --> 00:00:53.283
by creating a space

00:00:53.283 --> 00:00:57.033
for the next generation
of readers to thrive.

00:01:00.091 --> 00:01:02.054
The soft lighting and flowing shapes

00:01:02.054 --> 00:01:05.033
set a mood meant to entice
the literary curious

00:01:05.033 --> 00:01:08.533
to settle in for a storytelling adventure.

00:01:09.563 --> 00:01:12.146
(soft dinging)

